00:25:06.560 --> 00:25:10.280
When he comes back, tell him to go to the theater for the rehearsal tomorrow.

00:25:10.280 --> 00:25:11.230
He heard me.

00:25:11.920 --> 00:25:15.510
And as for you, don't be so confident.

00:25:16.620 --> 00:25:17.140
Milonguero!

00:25:17.510 --> 00:25:18.030
Pato!

00:25:18.250 --> 00:25:23.420
For you, I'm writing a tango that's going to be called Gato.

00:25:23.920 --> 00:25:26.750
Yes, to you, Caraduras.

00:25:30.320 --> 00:25:30.660
Bitch!

00:25:30.900 --> 00:25:31.120
What?

00:25:34.680 --> 00:25:34.840
What?

00:25:39.880 --> 00:25:40.820
Didn't you bring him in prison?

00:25:41.260 --> 00:25:43.560
He ran for the will.

00:25:43.740 --> 00:25:43.960
What?

00:25:44.720 --> 00:25:46.140
He stole the popular ones.

00:25:46.240 --> 00:25:48.270
And I asked for it, I asked for it!

00:25:48.270 --> 00:25:49.410
Give me back my helmet!

00:25:49.930 --> 00:25:51.700
And they didn't give it back to me.

00:25:51.780 --> 00:25:52.700
Good for your husband.

00:25:53.160 --> 00:25:53.620
That's it!

00:25:54.290 --> 00:25:55.890
Why do you have to touch the doubt like him?

00:25:56.110 --> 00:25:57.670
Thank you, ma'am, for the tip, huh?

00:25:57.870 --> 00:25:59.810
Oh, but how can I find it?

00:26:31.020 --> 00:26:32.120
The right one is here.

00:26:32.700 --> 00:26:37.200
Cheers to the end.

00:26:37.720 --> 00:26:38.920
So, the beluga is here.

00:26:38.920 --> 00:26:40.120
Yes, the beluga is here.

00:26:41.610 --> 00:26:43.180
I told you.

00:26:43.540 --> 00:26:45.760
Come on, Canuto, stop the show.

00:26:46.420 --> 00:26:48.070
Look, your wife is very jealous.

00:26:49.690 --> 00:26:50.890
You're right, brother.

00:26:51.290 --> 00:26:52.920
But it's me, you know.

00:26:53.740 --> 00:26:54.220
Me.

00:26:54.480 --> 00:26:54.860
You what?

00:26:55.650 --> 00:26:56.150
Me.

00:26:57.710 --> 00:26:59.470
I'm a son of a...

00:27:00.600 --> 00:27:02.220
May God protect you, Pijín!

00:27:02.520 --> 00:27:07.740
And to think that things were going so nice, so well...

00:27:07.740 --> 00:27:08.780
Do you remember the jingle?

00:27:09.100 --> 00:27:09.520
Do you remember?

00:27:18.320 --> 00:27:20.850
Mano de Hierro calls me reality.

00:27:22.100 --> 00:27:22.640
Forever.

00:27:30.920 --> 00:27:33.660
Don't worry, brother. Death is just a little while.

00:27:37.620 --> 00:27:40.670
Come on, son, play hard, so the neighbors don't find out.

00:27:40.690 --> 00:27:41.700
Yes, father.

00:27:41.940 --> 00:27:50.260
Come on, let's go.

00:28:31.400 --> 00:28:31.940
What's going on?

00:28:31.940 --> 00:28:38.230
A vile husband who is paying for his guilty loves.

00:28:39.100 --> 00:28:47.380
What's going on? Why are you beating around the bush?

00:28:47.580 --> 00:28:50.560
Ma'am, why are you hitting my friend's mellizo?

00:28:51.480 --> 00:28:55.600
What a poor little animal of God.

00:28:59.020 --> 00:28:59.540
Carlux!

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:02.100
...that I hit you.

00:29:03.260 --> 00:29:05.220
Now I'll ask you...

00:29:05.220 --> 00:29:11.510
...do you hate me? Do I hit you?

00:29:12.090 --> 00:29:14.300
Do you hate me? Do I not?

00:29:15.800 --> 00:29:18.830
Do you hate me? Do I not?

00:29:19.900 --> 00:29:23.900
Do you hate me? Do I not?

00:29:23.900 --> 00:29:25.060
Do I not?

00:29:31.530 --> 00:29:34.650
Well, give me Rodríguez and tell him to go to the Teatro Alegre tomorrow.

00:29:34.710 --> 00:29:35.660
Oh, thank you very much.

00:29:35.880 --> 00:29:45.070
I'm afraid that I'll get into your business, right?

00:29:45.910 --> 00:29:50.540
But tell me, why do you allow Jorge Rodríguez to exploit your work?

00:29:51.740 --> 00:29:58.020
Look, Tito, when I was an unknown illustrious, Jorge came to my aid and lent me his support.

00:29:58.470 --> 00:29:59.070
Ha ha ha ha!

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:01.660
You're such a tactician, my friend.

00:30:02.400 --> 00:30:05.860
No, it's just that Mrs. Malva premiered my first composition.

00:30:06.240 --> 00:30:07.700
She made a great success out of it.

00:30:07.720 --> 00:30:10.500
Oh, really? But the boyfriend took half of the rights.

00:30:10.780 --> 00:30:11.380
That doesn't matter.

00:30:12.100 --> 00:30:16.480
Ah, so... I know what's going on.

00:30:16.620 --> 00:30:16.780
What?

00:30:17.400 --> 00:30:19.660
You and... this.

00:30:20.470 --> 00:30:21.850
Please, my friend.

00:30:22.490 --> 00:30:24.470
You understand that she's Rodríguez's girlfriend.

00:30:24.470 --> 00:30:29.670
And I appreciate and admire her so much that when I work...

00:30:30.320 --> 00:30:36.470
I feel that my inspiration is in your voice, your gesture, and all the apparatus.

00:30:37.810 --> 00:30:42.400
Ah, the women! Ah, the women!

00:30:42.800 --> 00:30:42.860
What?

00:30:43.060 --> 00:30:45.340
You suckers!

00:30:46.030 --> 00:30:48.980
If you don't ask me...

00:30:50.100 --> 00:30:53.120
...two times, I'll blow that horn.

00:31:08.970 --> 00:31:13.900
I'm going to get out of here.

00:31:14.020 --> 00:31:15.960
I don't know when I'll be back.

00:31:16.300 --> 00:31:17.200
I'm out of breath.

00:31:17.480 --> 00:31:18.260
Ma'am.

00:31:18.260 --> 00:31:18.560
What?

00:31:19.340 --> 00:31:20.540
Be careful.

00:31:20.820 --> 00:31:22.340
The car is very dangerous.

00:31:24.040 --> 00:31:29.980
I'm telling you because once a sister of mine went for a drive and when...

00:31:30.000 --> 00:31:37.220
When she came back, she had to marry the chauffeur in a haste.

00:31:37.220 --> 00:31:42.240
Poor thing, do you understand me?

00:31:44.000 --> 00:31:47.070
I'm sorry for the chauffeur. Bye.

00:31:51.810 --> 00:31:53.850
Oh my God! Oh my God! Oh my God!

00:31:54.030 --> 00:31:54.610
What's going on?

00:31:54.910 --> 00:31:55.730
What's going on?

00:31:56.890 --> 00:31:57.670
What's going on?

00:31:57.710 --> 00:31:59.490
What's going on?

00:32:02.230 --> 00:32:22.770
The women! The women!

00:32:41.260 --> 00:32:43.290
Hello? Just a moment, sir.

00:32:43.370 --> 00:32:44.740
Miss, Mr. Jorge.

00:32:44.980 --> 00:32:45.240
Hello?

00:32:52.510 --> 00:32:52.790
Hello!

00:32:53.180 --> 00:32:56.250
Ah! Just to let you know that Julián is going to the theater to rehearse the tango.

00:32:56.560 --> 00:32:57.860
Attend to what I say right away.

00:32:58.410 --> 00:32:58.910
Don't bother.

00:33:00.000 --> 00:33:04.220
There is no need. I will proceed on my own with your excellent friend.

00:33:05.800 --> 00:33:06.020
Hello?

00:33:06.180 --> 00:33:08.720
Hello, Mrs. Malva?

00:33:08.840 --> 00:33:09.920
Just a moment, I have to let you know.

00:33:10.060 --> 00:33:10.420
Hello?

00:33:12.540 --> 00:33:12.740
Hello?

00:33:13.400 --> 00:33:21.290
The reason why I am here is that you are very in love with Malva.

00:33:21.290 --> 00:33:23.710
And Malva is not a wife, but she is very good.

00:33:31.400 --> 00:33:32.720
Make Mr. Cepeda come in.

00:33:32.740 --> 00:33:33.640
Right away, Miss.

00:33:34.080 --> 00:33:44.580
How much is it?

00:33:44.720 --> 00:33:47.820
Thank you, ma'am.

00:34:11.100 --> 00:34:13.920
I could not express the resentment that all this produces me.

00:34:13.960 --> 00:34:16.080
But it is necessary to put an end to so much anger.

00:34:16.550 --> 00:34:18.800
If you allow me, I will know how to proceed.

00:34:19.250 --> 00:34:22.030
Now, Sano, you must have understood.

00:34:22.490 --> 00:34:26.090
And I did not want my boyfriend to continue affirming what does not belong to him.

00:34:26.090 --> 00:34:28.830
And you, there you have the consequences.

00:34:30.280 --> 00:34:32.040
Everyone makes fun of my name.

00:34:32.340 --> 00:34:35.280
Your name for me is as sacred as my mother's.

00:34:36.610 --> 00:34:39.090
That's why I beg you to order me what I should do.

00:34:39.270 --> 00:34:41.420
And will you do it?

00:34:41.740 --> 00:34:43.180
To the cost of the greatest sacrifice.

00:34:43.910 --> 00:34:46.050
Then forget about us.

00:34:47.560 --> 00:34:48.340
Do it for me.

00:34:48.520 --> 00:34:53.580
You have talent, and at every step there will be artists who know how to value their compositions.

00:34:54.630 --> 00:34:59.380
Miss, the enthusiasm and affection that I have put in the compositions that I have performed today...

00:35:00.030 --> 00:35:02.430
They are not things that can be produced so easily.

00:35:03.430 --> 00:35:07.660
Besides, I have not always been happy feeling more artist than merchant.

00:35:08.270 --> 00:35:10.480
Sorry, I did not mean to offend you.

00:35:11.010 --> 00:35:11.530
That does not matter.

00:35:12.170 --> 00:35:17.930
The essential thing is that I must get away from you and your boyfriend.

00:35:34.700 --> 00:35:35.200
Thank you.

00:36:00.160 --> 00:36:00.500
Thank you.

00:36:30.410 --> 00:36:42.240
Sing, sing, sing, sing, sing on your own lips.

00:36:43.970 --> 00:36:46.990
Sing, ba-ba-boom, ba-ba-boom, ba-ba-boom, ba-ba-boom.

00:37:00.540 --> 00:37:01.980
Well, once again, let's go.

00:37:30.320 --> 00:37:30.580
Thank you.

00:38:00.480 --> 00:38:01.580
Well, you're done with the sale.

00:38:01.740 --> 00:38:11.110
...in the mouth.

00:38:11.530 --> 00:38:15.040
Can you tell me what that peasant painting means?

00:38:15.690 --> 00:38:16.550
You'll find out later.

00:38:16.950 --> 00:38:21.140
Chichipío, you and your friend,

00:38:21.600 --> 00:38:23.280
the wife of this lady,

00:38:23.660 --> 00:38:25.060
will have to suffer

00:38:25.060 --> 00:38:28.140
like we suffered the other day at the reservation.

00:38:29.190 --> 00:38:29.740
You remember?

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:30.220
...

00:38:30.310 --> 00:38:30.950
...

00:38:32.880 --> 00:38:33.700
...

00:38:35.940 --> 00:38:35.960
...

00:39:01.040 --> 00:39:03.980
Brother, I have to talk to you about a serious matter.

00:39:04.140 --> 00:39:04.560
Well?

00:39:05.110 --> 00:39:11.230
Brother, our wives cheat on us.

00:39:11.360 --> 00:39:11.820
To a couple?

00:39:11.980 --> 00:39:12.280
Yes.

00:39:12.670 --> 00:39:13.410
With another couple?

00:39:13.730 --> 00:39:13.970
Yes.

00:39:14.280 --> 00:39:15.840
Then a quarrel is forming.

00:39:15.860 --> 00:39:18.420
But if you talk seriously, the matter is serious.

00:39:18.680 --> 00:39:19.200
Don't be naive.

00:39:19.620 --> 00:39:20.520
I don't believe in that.

00:39:20.720 --> 00:39:22.140
I don't believe either, but I see it.

00:39:22.260 --> 00:39:22.860
What are you talking about?

00:39:23.380 --> 00:39:25.670
It's so big.

00:39:38.000 --> 00:39:39.930
How are you, Julián? But why don't you keep playing?

00:39:40.190 --> 00:39:41.870
Go ahead! Go ahead, Omar!

00:39:42.250 --> 00:39:43.260
Go ahead, yes!

00:39:43.620 --> 00:39:45.760
It's been a while since I heard you play this piano.

00:39:46.420 --> 00:39:47.080
Lack of will.

00:39:47.480 --> 00:39:49.560
Every day I feel less enthusiastic.

00:39:50.230 --> 00:39:52.110
But now that you are fired from your collaborator,

00:39:52.170 --> 00:39:55.440
you have the responsibility of maintaining your fame, friend.

00:39:56.140 --> 00:39:57.220
I have no interest.

00:40:00.000 --> 00:40:00.780
It's all the same to me.

00:40:00.960 --> 00:40:03.480
Yes, yes, I understand.

00:40:04.410 --> 00:40:05.270
It's her fault.

00:40:05.550 --> 00:40:05.750
Who?

00:40:06.070 --> 00:40:07.780
Who? Malva Suárez.

00:40:09.280 --> 00:40:11.440
Have they told me that after I broke up with Rodríguez...

00:40:11.440 --> 00:40:11.700
No.

00:40:11.940 --> 00:40:13.460
He has been losing his affection.

00:40:13.680 --> 00:40:19.400
And that Malva, in the desire to conquer him again, is willing to love me.

00:40:20.290 --> 00:40:21.210
But will it be possible?

00:40:24.540 --> 00:40:25.440
Do not miss him, friend.

00:40:26.160 --> 00:40:29.000
A woman in love is capable of that and many worse things.

00:40:31.690 --> 00:40:49.870
The music, the work, it was wonderful, che!

00:40:53.640 --> 00:40:56.540
Tango, for the character of his music, would have to be titled

00:40:57.080 --> 00:40:59.810
Pain, if I had to put the letter in

00:41:00.000 --> 00:41:12.380
It would start like this, pain, pain of loving and not being corresponded, pain that tortures me slowly, where can I cure this pain felt in the little mouth in front, huh?

00:41:14.780 --> 00:41:22.960
Friend Julián, I seriously ask you to play this music, I want to hear how the actor interprets it, do me a favor, don't stay.

00:42:41.520 --> 00:42:41.740
Continue!

00:42:42.200 --> 00:42:46.920
What? It's not worth it.

00:42:47.320 --> 00:42:53.780
I have to score a goal!

00:42:53.900 --> 00:42:55.070
Train him!

00:42:56.360 --> 00:42:57.200
Think about training more.

00:43:00.000 --> 00:43:00.760
This is going to the igloyó

00:43:03.060 --> 00:43:16.830
Tito, Tito, come Tito, come old man, brother, come, come old man, get out, get out with the pistucos, come, come

00:43:16.830 --> 00:43:29.940
They are gentlemen, we are two garras, we are going to present ourselves in society, it is not the first time that we are going to a...

00:43:30.060 --> 00:43:30.380
What?

00:44:00.990 --> 00:44:03.880
Ah, with Santillí, of course.

00:44:04.200 --> 00:44:09.240
Well, it's better that we speak in English, you know?

00:44:09.340 --> 00:44:11.500
Because there are so many impertinent people here.

00:44:11.840 --> 00:44:13.480
No, no.

00:44:13.800 --> 00:44:25.330
Well, I don't need anything.

00:44:34.380 --> 00:44:37.950
And well, we're not going to miss this show.

00:44:38.210 --> 00:44:40.190
Wherever you are, tell me you're going.

00:44:41.290 --> 00:44:43.570
Yes. So, wait for me at 5.

00:44:44.330 --> 00:44:44.850
Yes.

00:44:44.950 --> 00:44:45.370
Okay.

00:45:00.120 --> 00:45:01.110
Where are you going?

00:45:01.710 --> 00:45:04.120
We're going where we want to go.

00:45:04.320 --> 00:45:05.800
Then they go here, close by.

00:45:06.000 --> 00:45:08.820
And they bring money to pay the bus fare.

00:45:08.960 --> 00:45:11.270
They don't let you.

00:45:11.430 --> 00:45:13.100
They travel in mail trucks.

00:45:13.400 --> 00:45:13.840
Of course.

00:45:14.840 --> 00:45:18.020
I know, young man, in case you're interested.

00:45:18.520 --> 00:45:21.660
We're in El Rivero with two elegant, robust minstrels.

00:45:21.660 --> 00:45:24.240
The one who celebrates me and a Silviro breaks a nut.

00:45:24.660 --> 00:45:29.740
And mine, with one hand, lifts a piano and with the other...

00:45:31.890 --> 00:45:37.050
So, if you feel like men, come and look for us.

00:45:37.760 --> 00:45:39.920
Yes, are we in the living room?

00:45:40.520 --> 00:45:42.370
Let's have some copetines.

00:45:43.220 --> 00:45:44.040
Copetines, yes.

00:45:44.420 --> 00:45:45.660
And, baby?

00:45:45.900 --> 00:45:46.140
Okay.

00:46:06.470 --> 00:46:10.200
Oh, oh, oh, oh.

00:48:17.600 --> 00:48:29.940
I don't know, bad women, cyclists, like this, like this, and there are those athletes, the gypsies.

00:48:34.920 --> 00:48:39.780
Look, you're a gay.

00:48:40.140 --> 00:48:41.820
We're not gay.

00:48:42.640 --> 00:48:46.850
I'm a gay, you know?

00:48:47.190 --> 00:48:47.690
I'm not a gay.

00:48:48.110 --> 00:48:48.590
I don't know what to say.

00:48:48.630 --> 00:48:50.970
Get out of here.

00:48:52.740 --> 00:48:55.610
I'm going to screw you in a school.

00:49:00.060 --> 00:49:00.840
Linda, come here.

00:49:01.040 --> 00:49:01.340
What?

00:49:01.890 --> 00:49:02.950
Come here.

00:49:03.710 --> 00:49:04.270
What?

00:49:05.450 --> 00:49:09.750
Come and help me open the table, because I can't do it alone.

00:49:09.770 --> 00:49:09.990
Ah.

00:49:10.400 --> 00:49:25.590
It's a matter of habit.

00:49:25.930 --> 00:49:26.230
What?

00:49:26.230 --> 00:49:27.790
The same thing as...

00:49:27.790 --> 00:49:29.910
The same...

00:49:30.440 --> 00:49:30.720
What are you doing here?

00:49:30.920 --> 00:49:46.520
You have me weaving a little morning

00:49:46.580 --> 00:49:49.800
How do I trust this woman?

00:49:50.120 --> 00:49:52.570
There is no law of divorce

00:49:52.620 --> 00:49:54.340
When will it come?

00:49:54.720 --> 00:49:58.260
You are the weaver of Ñandutí

00:49:58.260 --> 00:49:59.850
Just let me fix this

00:50:07.080 --> 00:50:11.880
In the anniversary of my wedding, I want peace and joy to reign, do you understand?

00:50:12.260 --> 00:50:16.250
So I'm not going to allow you to martyrize your poor husband.

00:50:16.610 --> 00:50:19.490
Damn! Have they named him Defensor of Poor Plague?

00:50:20.070 --> 00:50:21.980
Tyrant! Verdugas!

00:50:22.250 --> 00:50:23.990
Ah, if you were my wife...

00:50:23.990 --> 00:50:26.110
What are you going to do? If I were your wife, what are you going to do to me?

00:50:26.530 --> 00:50:29.540
If you were my husband, I would eat him raw.

00:50:30.000 --> 00:50:32.520
The lamb meat is going to be bad for him.

00:50:35.120 --> 00:50:39.820
Brother, from what I told you, it is already fixed.

00:50:40.060 --> 00:50:42.700
Congratulations, you are a beast.

00:50:43.200 --> 00:50:47.330
How I would like to be a husband for the powerful illuminator like you.

00:50:47.650 --> 00:50:50.430
The class, the class, what are you going to do?

00:50:50.510 --> 00:50:51.590
You have to give me the recipe.

00:50:51.790 --> 00:50:52.830
What recipe?

00:50:53.240 --> 00:50:56.120
The recipe to illuminate my wife perfectly.

00:50:57.040 --> 00:50:59.260
Very well, I'll give you the recipe.

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:02.000
The medicine and the bandage for later.

00:51:02.340 --> 00:51:02.740
Uh-huh!

00:51:03.120 --> 00:51:04.340
Trin-to-soft!

00:51:04.560 --> 00:51:05.700
You're a pheno-venom!

00:51:05.740 --> 00:51:06.140
Ha-ha-ha!

00:51:06.240 --> 00:51:07.940
And those who don't know me yet!

00:51:08.420 --> 00:51:08.880
Ha-ha-ha!

00:51:09.280 --> 00:51:09.720
Tita!

00:51:11.120 --> 00:51:11.560
Tita!

00:51:13.460 --> 00:51:13.620
Tita!

00:51:13.720 --> 00:51:25.030
What a smell of olive!

00:51:46.030 --> 00:51:51.140
Chirtito, Chirtito, Chirtito, give me the recipe.

00:51:51.420 --> 00:51:53.790
Take it.

00:51:58.900 --> 00:51:59.860
So, Chirtito...

00:52:01.400 --> 00:52:04.530
Oh, with the pituco here of the bachelorette!

00:52:12.170 --> 00:52:19.100
So that you, the domineering, the arrogant, the gallant husband...

00:52:19.100 --> 00:52:20.640
I'm fine in the palm tree.

00:52:21.560 --> 00:52:24.180
Poor thing, you give me a pity.

00:52:25.060 --> 00:52:29.620
I deserve it, the fault is mine, my fault.

00:52:30.960 --> 00:52:31.580
Mea culpa.

00:52:36.100 --> 00:52:37.140
Thank you, Adito.

00:52:37.200 --> 00:52:39.570
You look like a husband to me.

00:52:39.950 --> 00:52:40.610
Well, enough, enough!

00:52:41.530 --> 00:52:42.810
Lately, I don't care about anything.

00:52:42.990 --> 00:52:47.360
In short, a woman is not worth much.

00:52:47.640 --> 00:52:51.030
She's uglier than pretty, older than young,

00:52:51.290 --> 00:52:54.210
has longer legs than arms,

00:52:55.420 --> 00:52:59.480
short neck, big mouth, and...

00:53:00.320 --> 00:53:00.860
She has two ears.

00:53:01.140 --> 00:53:01.980
You're right, brother.

00:53:02.590 --> 00:53:04.210
I didn't want to tell you one thing,

00:53:04.350 --> 00:53:07.620
but as a friend of yours, I'm going to tell you.

00:53:07.920 --> 00:53:08.060
What?

00:53:08.280 --> 00:53:12.880
Your wife has a flat nose.

00:53:12.960 --> 00:53:14.670
She's flatter than your grandmother.

00:53:14.870 --> 00:53:15.630
But Tito...

00:53:15.630 --> 00:53:16.850
I won't allow you to criticize her.

00:53:17.140 --> 00:53:18.720
Only I can talk about my wife.

00:53:19.780 --> 00:53:20.300
It's my fault!

00:54:00.090 --> 00:54:00.570
Hello, my soul.

00:54:00.710 --> 00:54:02.160
I was waiting for you.

00:54:02.770 --> 00:54:05.370
Did you forget that today we are invited to the painting party?

00:54:05.610 --> 00:54:06.650
Ah, it's true, Linda.

00:54:06.910 --> 00:54:07.990
I'll change right away and let's go.

00:54:08.040 --> 00:54:08.560
Come on in.

00:54:08.640 --> 00:54:14.580
