00:54:18.010 --> 00:54:19.790
Posa, the famous editor.

00:54:23.020 --> 00:54:23.800
Girlfriend, right?

00:54:24.120 --> 00:54:26.640
I know her through her performance.

00:54:27.330 --> 00:54:28.570
I'm her admirer.

00:54:28.890 --> 00:54:29.980
I love...

00:54:31.150 --> 00:54:33.080
I'm sorry, I'm going to change.

00:54:33.400 --> 00:54:41.600
I'm going to confess to Jorge that it is you who will sing the next songs that we are going to compose.

00:54:41.940 --> 00:54:44.800
So you are his new collaborator.

00:54:45.640 --> 00:54:50.540
No, I just proposed to take care of the future of this boy.

00:54:51.020 --> 00:54:53.740
I will use my influences, I will be a journalist,

00:54:54.260 --> 00:54:57.140
I will obtain from my husband the publication of his compositions.

00:54:57.640 --> 00:54:59.980
If you knew that...

00:55:00.060 --> 00:55:02.440
