00:55:04.250 --> 00:55:04.770
Ready!

00:55:09.270 --> 00:55:10.470
Congratulations, Jorge.

00:55:10.650 --> 00:55:13.460
You can tell me that this lady...

00:55:13.460 --> 00:55:16.760
