00:55:17.000 --> 00:55:19.420
You must be grateful to your good star.

00:55:20.080 --> 00:55:21.220
Our good star.

00:55:22.130 --> 00:55:22.710
Because you...

00:55:22.710 --> 00:55:24.170
...will be the first interpreter.

00:55:25.050 --> 00:55:27.160
Oh, true charm.

00:55:30.670 --> 00:55:32.790
I'm sorry to have to reject such an experience.

00:55:33.190 --> 00:55:33.310
