00:55:33.710 --> 00:55:37.920
I have the purpose of not releasing more pieces in the rest of the season.

00:55:38.860 --> 00:55:39.360
Good afternoon.

00:55:39.920 --> 00:55:42.090
Marla, what does this design mean?

00:55:43.080 --> 00:55:44.560
Don't you understand that it's about my future?

00:55:44.980 --> 00:55:48.000
I came so that we could go to Chica's house.

00:55:48.210 --> 00:55:48.910
Come or not.

00:55:49.130 --> 00:55:49.330
What?

00:55:50.220 --> 00:55:54.480
Would you like us to finish talking about our projects?

00:55:56.680 --> 00:55:58.960
Marla, I'm staying.

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:00.320
They were friends.

00:56:02.070 --> 00:56:03.610
I don't care about that kind of people.

00:56:04.810 --> 00:56:05.150
Fine.

00:56:12.080 --> 00:56:12.820
She's yours.

00:56:13.080 --> 00:56:16.640
But in the end, do everything you want.

00:57:27.740 --> 00:57:28.980
Sit up.

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:36.520
They laugh from the outside, and they laugh from the inside, and they laugh from all sides.

00:57:36.640 --> 00:57:37.300
Come on, come on.

00:57:37.300 --> 00:57:38.370
Come on, come on.

00:57:38.900 --> 00:57:39.640
