00:57:40.400 --> 00:57:41.180
Come on, laugh.

00:57:42.540 --> 00:57:43.380
Pure optimist face.

00:57:43.760 --> 00:57:44.180
Majority face.

00:57:44.240 --> 00:57:44.580
Come on.

00:57:46.460 --> 00:57:47.340
No, not like that.

00:57:47.700 --> 00:57:47.820
No.

00:57:48.020 --> 00:57:49.360
