00:57:53.570 --> 00:57:54.630
Come on.

00:57:54.630 --> 00:57:55.790
Come on.

00:57:56.200 --> 00:57:57.180
Come on.

00:57:57.580 --> 00:57:57.980
Laugh.

00:57:58.640 --> 00:57:59.040
Laugh.

00:57:59.570 --> 00:57:59.970
Laugh.

00:58:02.320 --> 00:58:12.260
I know you have such a faithful little woman.

00:58:12.520 --> 00:58:17.010
