01:07:28.370 --> 01:07:29.970
Presentation, the celebrated...

01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:47.270
Concertista, Mista, Serpiente's singer, Chorro, Chavale, Tabay, Baizizi,

01:07:47.450 --> 01:07:49.950
