01:08:00.280 --> 01:08:04.780
Now they will make the most terrible man with the saxophone service.

01:08:04.780 --> 01:08:07.670
The man who puts fire on the instrument.

01:08:08.630 --> 01:08:12.810
The knight with the high barrier with the stick stuck in the toy.

01:08:16.050 --> 01:08:17.910
I'm going to introduce you to this little boy.

01:08:18.440 --> 01:08:21.040
When this little boy plays, he becomes a king, boy.

01:08:21.630 --> 01:08:21.990
