Aha.

01:15:37.450 --> 01:15:38.290
Yes, because he does this.

01:15:43.170 --> 01:15:54.990
Ladies and gentlemen, I have to tell you

01:15:54.990 --> 01:15:57.450
that the cult of extranjism and the piquet of progress

01:15:57.790 --> 01:15:59.770
have never beaten the...

