Inspired by my salt, where the arrabal prays the joy and the pain.

01:16:34.560 --> 01:16:38.250
My salt of verses humble, happy, sad, suffered.

01:16:39.040 --> 01:16:42.540
Verses that say of forgetfulness, of affection, of passion, of hope.

01:16:46.900 --> 01:16:49.760
Son of the candombe raised in the arrabal.

01:16:50.240 --> 01:16:53.620
Now made a very clean and refined bacán,

01:16:53.620 --> 01:16:57.760
