01:22:46.190 --> 01:22:49.240
You forgot about my nightmares. I was afraid you wouldn't come.

01:22:51.520 --> 01:22:53.520
Look at the peasant.

01:22:54.500 --> 01:22:56.000
He's coming to be important.

01:22:57.540 --> 01:22:59.970
That frack of yours, I bought it for you.

01:23:00.000 --> 01:23:01.900
It's me. Poor thing.

01:23:02.960 --> 01:23:06.920
Since he hasn't collaborated with me, he hasn't trained anymore.

01:23:08.150 --> 01:23:11.320
Young, pastored.

01:23:12.000 --> 01:23:15.750
And you, you, have you trained any more tango?

01:23:17.130 --> 01:23:17.490
No.

01:23:20.310 --> 01:23:23.250
Come on, it seems a lie.

01:23:23.940 --> 01:23:25.040
It doesn't matter to him.

01:23:25.360 --> 01:23:27.820
It's a case of contagion.

01:23:28.100 --> 01:23:29.640
Don't you see that next to him there's the silly virula?

01:23:30.720 --> 01:23:36.920
Hey, how are the vegetables?

01:23:38.120 --> 01:23:40.160
What do the cows say?

01:23:40.580 --> 01:23:41.280
The cows!

01:23:41.640 --> 01:23:44.040
And how is this shepherd?

01:23:44.980 --> 01:23:51.500
Hey, shepherd, tonight I'm going to sing a tango that is properly for you.

01:23:53.130 --> 01:23:59.660
And to you, I do not forgive you that you have left like this to the sardines.

01:24:00.440 --> 01:24:02.300
without giving me even the grace

01:24:03.400 --> 01:24:05.640
because the prestige of composer

01:24:06.440 --> 01:24:08.250
owes it to me

01:24:08.570 --> 01:24:11.160
of what I am very grateful to you

01:24:13.740 --> 01:24:14.940
peasant brute

01:24:14.940 --> 01:24:28.960
I want to go to the bathroom, my love

01:24:30.000 --> 01:24:32.600
You came out with your own, eh?

01:24:34.280 --> 01:24:46.630
If you stand in front of me, because the visual bothers me,

01:24:46.630 --> 01:24:49.790
if you stand in front of me, I don't see anything, absolutely nothing.

01:24:50.570 --> 01:24:53.160
But tell me what happened, tell me, tell me.

01:24:53.560 --> 01:24:56.480
You don't know what happened?

01:24:56.660 --> 01:24:56.880
No.

01:24:56.980 --> 01:24:59.340
That after a brief discussion...

01:25:00.280 --> 01:25:10.050
The man did this to the other, but it is clear that the other did not answer him like this.

01:25:10.820 --> 01:25:18.800
Indeed, but the other immediately did this to him, and the discussion ended.

01:25:18.900 --> 01:25:20.940
No, no, but this time, sir, no, no, no, no.

01:25:21.080 --> 01:25:25.470
The logic says that this cannot have ended like this.

01:25:25.720 --> 01:25:29.200
No, no, this must have ended like this.

01:25:30.030 --> 01:25:33.500
Yes, we are going to have a drink.

01:25:33.830 --> 01:25:35.970
At last we have agreed.

01:25:36.950 --> 01:25:37.510
Let's go.

01:25:37.850 --> 01:25:44.680
For the first time, a celebrated author of our popular music will be presented to the public.

01:25:44.680 --> 01:25:48.940
Who will then make you hear his last inspired tangazo.

01:28:00.190 --> 01:28:03.170
Your love is more than love itself

01:28:04.240 --> 01:28:07.670
And here I come for that

01:28:07.670 --> 01:28:09.520
To erase my five kisses

01:28:09.520 --> 01:28:11.120
In the kisses of another

01:28:11.120 --> 01:28:15.570
Your love is not only mine

01:28:15.570 --> 01:28:17.550
The power that causes that between us

01:28:17.550 --> 01:28:19.190
That cruel concern

01:28:19.190 --> 01:28:22.560
I look through the eyes

01:28:22.560 --> 01:28:25.340
To forget my obstination

01:28:34.760 --> 01:28:50.850
The crazy girl, your friend, left me and thought that the other one was your friend.

01:29:03.580 --> 01:29:24.560
We'll be right back.

01:29:31.440 --> 01:29:34.080
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

01:30:00.760 --> 01:30:05.260
to listen to your crazy laugh, to feel next to my mouth like a fire

01:30:05.260 --> 01:30:18.730
to feel abandoned and to think that I have crossed your side soon, soon

01:31:09.400 --> 01:31:11.360
Stay still, I know what I'm saying.

01:31:11.780 --> 01:31:13.280
Look, there could be...

01:31:13.280 --> 01:31:13.600
What?

01:31:13.760 --> 01:31:15.700
I congratulate you for La Plancha.

01:31:15.940 --> 01:31:16.380
Plancha?

01:31:16.480 --> 01:31:16.720
Yes.

01:31:16.920 --> 01:31:18.780
Wasn't it bad that I was going to release a tango for you?

01:31:18.780 --> 01:31:20.770
Don't worry, I'm going to release it.

01:31:21.030 --> 01:31:25.050
Look, I advise you to go find your girlfriend before it's too late.

01:31:25.270 --> 01:31:25.510
What?

01:31:27.190 --> 01:31:29.610
Hasn't the one who can blow me a lady been born yet?

01:31:31.080 --> 01:31:34.130
I am who I am, and that's all.

01:31:34.370 --> 01:31:35.680
And that's all?

01:31:37.260 --> 01:31:42.660
Well, didn't you offer him a tango?

01:31:42.960 --> 01:31:44.840
Oh, that's right, I forgot.

01:31:45.860 --> 01:31:51.180
I'm going to play him a tango that's like his own, but with the greatest pleasure.

01:31:52.080 --> 01:31:56.500
And yes, Nina, come here, listen, listen to something.

01:31:57.580 --> 01:31:58.560
This is what it's going to be like.

01:32:09.120 --> 01:32:14.660
Life is a featherless bird that mixes with people in favor of their arms,

01:32:14.840 --> 01:32:18.040
that shows itself when there are good ones, but in the bad one it fumes,

01:32:18.200 --> 01:32:21.960
that stretches in the relieved, that dyes in the tainted,

01:32:22.200 --> 01:32:26.020
that approaches the stranger, that dresses with foam,

01:32:26.340 --> 01:32:29.700
that appears to be overflowing, that is going to overflow.

